[wait_input]
if {player_name_intro} == "":
	security_person: Make sure you introduce yourself to The Fox first before I give you your R-Card
	[end_timeline]
player_name: Hello, is this Campus Security?
security_person: This is indeed Campus Security!
security_person: And you must be here for your R-Card right?
- Yes, I am!
	jump continue story
- No sorry i'm looking for something else.
	security_person: Ok, I hope you find what your looking for!
	[end_timeline]
label continue story
security_person: Great! I just need to know your R-Number before I give you your card.
[text_input text="Enter your R-Number:" var="first_quest.r_number" placeholder="number"]
player_name: Of course! It's {first_quest.r_number}
security_person: Fantastic, here is your card! I hope you have a wonderful time at Rollins!
security_person: Make sure you go talk to The Fox again and let them know you got your R-Card.
jump intro/return_to_fox